-**Parameters:**
-*   **Learning Rate:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Mesh Type:** SMPL-X or FLAME for human avatars [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Optimization Method:** Stochastic Gradient Descent (SGD) or Adam [G].
